or: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</p><div align="center"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0mm; vertical-align: top;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="padding: 0mm; vertical-align: top;"><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0mm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Dear Agency Partner,</p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0mm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0mm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Your recent application for Ticketing Authority has been approved.</p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0mm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 15pt; margin: 0mm; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">This decision was made with Qantas' sole discretion and are contingent on continued compliance with your obligations within Qantas' Standard Agency Terms and Conditions, available on the homepage
